  "dual_element_rule": "Multiply the attacker's multiplier against each of the defender's elements. A Tide/Gale defender hit by Volt takes 2.0 x 2.0 = 4.0.",
  "escort_ability_rules": {
    "$comment": "Answers decision 1 in 09-risks-and-roadmap.md: 'Limited — one resident gives an active ability.' One escort, one charge per encounter, no autonomous action. The escort never attacks on its own; that is the line between a limited companion and a pet sim.",
